  "title": "Fix flaky waits in 6 HTML tests and wait for images in shadow roots",
  "body": "> Seven HTML tests failed CI intermittently and passed on rerun.\n\n## Changelog Entry\n\n### Fixed\n\n- 👷🏻 Fixed 7 flaky HTML tests that snapshot or assert before the state settles, in PR [#5943](https://github.com/microsoft/BotFramework-WebChat/pull/5943), by [@OEvgeny](https://github.com/OEvgeny)\n\n## Description\n\nThese tests asserted or took snapshots before the state settled. Each now waits for the state it checks (CI run/job of a failure in parentheses), snapshots unchanged.\n\n## Specific Changes\n\n- `suggestedActions.noAccessKey.html`: live region faded (1 s) before the assert → `internalLiveRegionFadeAfter: 60000` (39502280172/118904934723)\n- `typeInChatHistorySendFocusToSendBox.html`: echo arrived before the ack, \"Sending\" in snapshot → `allOutgoingActivitiesSent()` (39239542866/118018569673)\n- `inputCard.withStyleOptions.html`: snapshot before the \"You posted\" reply → `await` keys, wait for 3 activities (39491695942/118868437264)\n- `useScrollTo.activityID.html`: 200 ms sleep before the scroll event → `waitFor()` (39331959732/118334391318)\n- `bargeIn/behavior.html`: abort/new recognition run in effects after the click → `waitFor()` (39317650226/118285925793)\n- `useRelativeTimeFormatter.html`: exact 24/48 h slipped by 1 ms → fake clock (39176636909/117821601872)\n- Harness `allImagesCompleted`: skipped shadow roots, `customElement/shadowRoot.html` missed its image → walk open shadow roots (39496453747/118884450183)\n\n- [x] I have added tests and executed them locally\n- [x] I have added `.changelog/<PR#>-<slug>.md`\n- [ ] I have updated documentation\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n> This section is for contributors to review your work.\n\n- [ ] Accessibility reviewed (tab order, content readability, alt text, color contrast)\n- [ ] Browser and platform compatibilities reviewed\n- [ ] CSS styles reviewed (minimal rules, no `z-index`)\n- [ ] Documents reviewed (docs, samples, live demo)\n- [ ] Internationalization reviewed (strings, unit formatting)\n- [ ] `package.json` and `package-lock.json` reviewed\n- [ ] Security reviewed (no data URIs, check for nonce leak)\n- [ ] Tests reviewed (coverage, legitimacy)\n",
